msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Panimula"

msgid "What is the addressbook?"
msgstr "Ano ang addressbook?"

msgid "The addressbook application is part of your I2P installation."
msgstr "Ang aplikasyon ng addressbook ay bahagi ng iyong pagkakabit ng I2P."

msgid "It regularly updates your hosts.txt file from distributed sources or \"subscriptions\"."
msgstr "Regular na ini-update nito ang iyong hosts.txt file mula sa mga ipinamamahagiagang source o \"subscription\"."

msgid "Subscribing to additional sites is easy, just add them to your <a href=\"subscriptions\">subscriptions</a> file."
msgstr "Madaling mag-subscribe sa mga karagdagang site, idagdag mo lang ang mga ito sa iyong <a href=\"subscriptions\">subscriptions</a> file."

msgid "For more information on naming in I2P, see <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>the overview</a>."
msgstr "Para sa higit pang impormasyon tungkol sa naming sa I2P, tingnan ang <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>ang overview</a>."

msgid "How does the addressbook application work?"
msgstr "Paano gumagana ang aplikasyon ng addressbook?"

msgid "The addressbook application regularly polls your subscriptions and merges their content into your \"router\" address book."
msgstr "Regular na ini-polling ng aplikasyon ng addressbook ang iyong subscription at pinagsasama ang kanilang nilalaman sa iyong \"router\" address book."

msgid "Then it merges your \"master\" address book into the router address book as well."
msgstr "Pagkatapos, pinagsasama rin nito ang iyong \"master\" address book sa router address book."

msgid "If configured, the router address book is now written to the \"published\" address book, which will be publicly available if you are running an eepsite."
msgstr "Kung naka-configure, isinusulat na ng router address book sa \"published\" address book, na magiging pampublikong available kung may eepsite ka."

msgid "The router also uses a private address book, which is not merged or published."
msgstr "Ginagamit din ng router ang pribadong address book, na hindi pinagsasama o iipublish."

msgid "Hosts in the private address book can be accessed by you but their addresses are never distributed to others."
msgstr "Maaari mong i-access ang mga host sa pribadong address book ngunit kailanman hindi ipinamahagi sa iba ang kanilang address."

msgid "The private address book can also be used for aliases of hosts in your other address books."
msgstr "Maaaring gamitin din ang pribadong address book para sa mga alias ng host sa iyong iba pang address book."

msgid "subscription log"
msgstr "log ng subscription"

msgid "Subscription Log"
msgstr "Log ng Subscription"

msgid "Most recent (excluding bad domains)"
msgstr "Pinakabagong (walang kasamang masamang domain)"

msgid "subscriptions"
msgstr "mga subscription"

msgid "The subscription file contains a list of i2p URLs."
msgstr "Ang subscription file ay naglalaman ng listahan ng i2p URL."

msgid "The addressbook application regularly checks this list for new eepsites."
msgstr "Regular na sinusuri ng aplikasyon ng addressbook ang listahang ito para sa bagong eepsite."

msgid "Those URLs refer to published hosts.txt files."
msgstr "Ang mga URL na iyon ay tumutukoy sa mga nai-publish na hosts.txt file."

msgid "See the FAQ for a list of subscription URLs."
msgstr "Tingnan ang FAQ para sa listahan ng subscription URL."
